        },
        {
          "text": "silethe lenhlama yethu yokuqala, lezithelo zezihlahla zonke, lewayini lamafutha kubapristi eziphaleni zendlu kaNkulunkulu wethu; silethe lakumaLevi okwetshumi okuvela emasimini ethu, ngoba yiwo amaLevi aqoqa okwetshumi emizini yethu yonke esemaphandleni.",
