        {
          "text": "AbakoIsrayeli lamaLevi bazakuletha umnikelo wamabele lewayini lamafutha ezindlini lapho kulondolozwa khona izitsha zethempeli, lalapho abapristi abaphatha umsebenzi labalindi bamasango labahlabeleli bahlala khona. Kasiyikuyivilaphela indlu kaNkulunkulu wethu.",
